      399.13,
      539.9,
      443.08
    ],
    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in the Consumer Affairs Authority by Section 10 (1) (a) of the Consumer Affairs AuthorityAct, No. 09 of 2003, the Consumer Affairs Authority directs all traders that they shall cause to be fixed in some conspicuouspart or place of their shop/ outlet a weighing scale verified for its accuracy by the Department of Measurement UnitsStandards and Services, for the consumers to weigh any items prior to/ affer purchasing if they shall so require.",
